Notes:
  • normalized_edit: single-number rough dissimilarity (char-level).
  • SequenceMatcher.ratio: difflib similarity on full strings (good for prose).
  • line_ndiff: coarse line presence; small line edits count as -/+ pairs.
  • data-bbox: quads parsed from data-bbox="…"; compared in extraction order.
    sum_L1 / max_L1 / max_abs_delta apply only to the first min(count) pairs.
    Relative error vs B: quad is left,top,right,bottom; left/right use W_B=|right-left|;
      top/bottom use H_B=|bottom-top|; denominators from B, min 1 px. A=first file, B=second.

